          "text": "Oona's Potion"
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2A.Name",
          "text": "Clause"
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2A.Description",
          "text": "After a years-long search for a potion to increase her productivity, Oona found an ancient recipe that promised to grant her what she desperately sought."
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2A.Ending",
          "text": "If only she had read the fine print..."
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2B.Name",
          "text": "Copies"
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2B.Description",
          "text": "Rumour has it that Oona has been up to no good, making a ruckus. She, however, insists she hasn’t been here for weeks."
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2B.Ending",
          "text": "It’s as if there have been other versions of herself walking around."
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2C.Name",
          "text": "Chaos"
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2C.Description",
          "text": "The whole clone situation is way over her head, and Oona is left wondering if she'll ever keep them in line."
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6484,
          "source_table": "LevelsStandalone",
          "key": "Level.Campaign3_Level2C.Ending",
          "text": "With no end in sight, she gives up on trying to control them, relaxes, and embraces the madness."
        },
        {
          "source_text_asset_id": 6489,
          "source_table": "Store",
          "key": "Store.VersionWhatsNew.28",
          "text": "Follow the aftermath of Oona's disastrous potion in the new Wetlands biome, and discover the new buildings, trees, and cuisine it has to offer!"
        }
